# W-WEB-1 — Static HTML from S

## Builtins
- html_escape(text) — XSS baseline escape
- html_tag(name, body [, attrs map])
- html_page(title, body_html)

## CLI
  s html build site.s --out=dir

## Example
  examples/static_site/site.s

## Non-goals (later waves)
- Live server (W-WEB-2)
- Forms (W-WEB-3)
